      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": 118,
          "content": "# Meridian scheduler\nMeridian schedules shared observatory instruments. Reservation rules below concern confirmed night-time observations, not daytime training sessions.\n## Services\nThe reservation service accepts requests, a planner assigns intervals, and an instrument gateway executes approved schedules. The calendar displays plans but cannot authorize execution.\n## Navigation\nRead [Transfer](reservations.md#transfer), [Weather](weather.md#suspension), and [Clock](clock.md#clock-offset) for operational details. The calendar's [colours](calendar.md#colours) are display conventions.",
          "metadata": "{\"types\":[\"heading\",\"text\"],\"level\":1,\"path\":[\"Meridian scheduler\",\"Navigation\"]}",
          "sort_order": 0,
          "embedding_bytes": null,
          "sha256": "738174e18453401063579edf13e36118be899852d95cb62f3c7af310d5227ee5",
          "exact_source_substring": false,
          "source_line_span": null
        }
      ],
