      "updated_at": "2026-11-08 08:50:41",
      "depth": 0,
      "source_content_type": "text/markdown",
      "content_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vanilla1999/DocAtlas/e62fa9e357bd22731cddabe930532a4a2faecc18/eval/blind_project_context/step14-host-language-live/frozen-corpus/reservations.md",
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": 119,
          "content": "# Confirmed reservations\nThese rules apply to confirmed night-time reservations on shared instruments.\nFor orientation, the reservation console links to the calendar's [colour legend](calendar.md#colours).\n## Transfer\nTransfer a reservation only after the receiving observer accepts it and the duty operator approves the transfer. Retain the original reservation identifier and record both observers in the audit trail. A transfer does not alter the [weather suspension](weather.md#suspension).\n## Locked instrument\nIf the instrument has an active maintenance lock, leave the transfer pending even after observer acceptance and operator approval. The lock must be cleared by the instrument team first.",
          "metadata": "{\"types\":[\"heading\",\"text\"],\"level\":1,\"path\":[\"Confirmed reservations\",\"Locked instrument\"]}",
          "sort_order": 0,
          "embedding_bytes": null,
          "sha256": "10548b5bb4e8bfab5191a20e27540a1cdd68defef7c817e20ce336028aa8ada4",
          "exact_source_substring": false,
          "source_line_span": null
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "content": "## Training slots\nDaytime training slots can be reassigned by an instructor without the night-time approval workflow. This shortcut does not apply to confirmed observations.",
          "metadata": "{\"types\":[\"heading\",\"text\"],\"level\":2,\"path\":[\"Confirmed reservations\",\"Training slots\"]}",
          "sort_order": 1,
          "embedding_bytes": null,
          "sha256": "53c1a6c0d06fdb0a9000a2d2115121274aac1a3c692d480d8b99163bb428280d",
          "exact_source_substring": false,
          "source_line_span": null
        }
      ],
